{"title":"Mock AIME 2 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Given that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/f/8bf660aa66857a6edb2398f997b04b57c6005c99.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$iz^2=1+\\frac 2z + \\frac{3}{z^2}+\\frac{4}{z ^3}+\\frac{5}{z^4}+\\cdots$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"262\" height=\"37\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55c206f489163f5582d586a957dca7d4dc48e67.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z=n\\pm \\sqrt{-i},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"106\" height=\"20\" /> find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/f/31f55d19ae2b4aadfc7b7f46778090bf0c54c322.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor 100n \\rfloor$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"51\" height=\"19\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Multiplying both sides of the equation by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, we get\n</p>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/d/73dd020de5a5408e6f52c937e7fa8d3ad55908ad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$iz^3 = z + 2 + \\frac{3}{z} + \\frac{4}{z^2} + \\cdots$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"208\" height=\"37\" />,</center>\n<p>and subtracting the original equation from this one we get\n</p>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/0/480103d40eb8a07b9f7e95e6b28f7e18bebacdf5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$iz^2(z-1)=z+1+\\frac{1}{z}+\\frac{1}{z^2}+\\frac{1}{z^3}+\\cdots$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"305\" height=\"37\" />.</center>\n<p>Using the formula for an infinite geometric series, we find\n</p>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/d/fcd64829e67ebcc4eab6aa004f4ebf575367775d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$iz^2(z-1)=\\frac{z}{1-\\frac{1}{z}}=\\frac{z^2}{z-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"215\" height=\"45\" />.</center>\n<p>Rearranging, we get\n</p>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/9/c990fcfac5ea595298da9e3f9b72af3d76bdd42f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$iz^2(z-1)^2=z^2\\iff (z-1)^2=\\frac{1}{i}=-i\\Rightarrow z=1\\pm\\sqrt{-i}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"452\" height=\"37\" />.</center>\n<p>Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/9/1d96ecc15129c5631ba4a2c6578e91e3d13e3baf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, and the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/4/9e45094cb7d5452fce6db79d1b07998853983f96.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor 100n \\rfloor = \\boxed{100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"117\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 2006-2007\">Mock AIME 2 2006-2007</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 2006-2007 Problems\">Problems</a></b>, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/viewtopic.php?t={{{source}}}\">Source</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018035944\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.019 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.024 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 118/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1448/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 194/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2083/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.461      1 Template:Mock_AIME_box\n100.00%    7.461      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:3525:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018035944 and revision id 46094. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}